id: magic-warrior
name: Magic Warrior
talentCategory: magic-attack
prerequisites: Magic Score of 6+
description: >
  Able to use magical power to supplement your physical might or ki blasts, your magical prowess is more than enough to stand up to others in combat.
text: >
  Magic Warrior: Able to use magical power to supplement your physical might or ki blasts, your magical prowess is more than enough to stand up to others in combat.
  –Prerequisites: Magic Score of 6+
  (1)-[Passive]: You gain access to all Energy Profiles.
  (2)-[Passive]: You may use your Magic Modifier as the Damage Attribute for all Physical and Energy Attacks.

---

[passive]
# (1) Energy Attacks whatever the Force Score (maneuvers.mjs whyNotThisFoundation).
allow magicWarrior.energyAccess;
# (2) A Physical or Energy Attack's Damage Attribute your Magic Modifier, where it is the higher (maneuvers.mjs favoredDamage).
allow magicWarrior.damage;
